# Staging

Structured items awaiting Notion push. Each file here has full frontmatter and is ready to sync.

## Frontmatter Format

```yaml
---
id: <UUID>
type: task|note|event|action
status: pending|synced|archived
source: discord|voice|email|manual
created: <ISO8601>
notion_id: <UUID or empty>
tags: [tag1, tag2]
---
```

## Sync Process

1. Sweeper scans for `status: pending`
2. Batches files into single Notion API call
3. Writes back `notion_id` and sets `status: synced`
4. Moves file to `archive/`

The `id` field makes retries safe — re-running push against same IDs won't create duplicates.
